Would you like to know what bug or insect is it? No problem! Use the Bug Identifier App - Insect ID app to identify by photo more than 6,000 classes of insects and other terrestrial invertebrates, such as: Bugs, Butterflies, Beetles, Moths, Spiders, Ants, Bees, Wasps, Weevils, Termites, Cockroaches, Centipedes, Multipedes, Dragonflies and more from all over the world. Discover the world of insects and other invertebrates around you with the Bug Identifier App - Insect ID app!

Whether you're a student, a nature enthusiast, or simply curious about the world around you, Bug Identifier App - Insect ID is the perfect app for anyone looking to learn more about the fascinating world of insects. Try it today and start exploring!
 
APP CONTENT & MAIN FEATURES: 

• Bugs & Insects Identifier  •
Simply take a photo or select photo from your gallery and get an accurate result in just seconds with detailed information about your identified insect, such as: probability, insect name, description, rank, taxonomy, similar images and more, but may vary. App can identify a wide variety of insects - more than 6,000 classes of insects from all over the world, from common household pests like ants and cockroaches, to more exotic species like butterflies and beetles, and others.  

• Texts Library •
 Read more than 20 interesting texts, such as: 10 World’s Most Beautiful Bugs & Insects and more.

*Note: For a more accurate insect identification, please take or select high-quality photo so that the insect is visible and is alone in the photo, avoid other insects in background.

Note that free version of the app is limited to:
– 1 Bug or Insect Identification;
– 1 Text for Reading.
If you want to use the app without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”Premium Access” is available.

